[28.303922, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Provider: anthropic-vertex\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Model: claude-sonnet-4-5\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Skill: pentest\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Working directory: /tmp/ami-demo-Yq4iPW\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Session: session-20261113-152753-301-0\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[90mermissions: auto-allow\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mTip: Run \u001b[1m/model\u001b[22m to switch models on the fly.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > Use the Kali MCP server to run nmap against 192.168.1.128, scanning only TCP port 53269. Save the\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m raw nmap output to nmap-result.txt in the current directory, then print a one-line summary stating \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mwhether the port is open, closed, or filtered. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;75m\u26a1 loading skill: pentest \u2014 MCP tools enabled\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI'll connect to the Kali MCP server, run the nmap scan against the specified target and port, then\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Ksave and summarize the results.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b[38;5;167m\u25cf\u001b[39m \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;167mmcp__kali__connect\u001b[39m\u001b[22m\u001b[2m \u00b7 \u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;243m{}\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;167m|\u001b[39m mcp__kali__connect {} \u001b[2m0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250